:- module(palette, [type(col/0, [red, green])]).

% `palette` exports both `red` and `green`. `user` never imports it,
% so the qualified reference `palette:red` must fail with
% `YCHR-20014` (`ModuleNotImported`) — not the misleading
% `YCHR-20010` ("does not export") that a program-wide constructor map
% would otherwise produce.
:- chr_type col ---> red ; green ; blue.
